{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "f69403cfd2515dd731070afae777b8dda8027073cbf20cf02f77c5cb801e42b6", "ja": "優柔と不満", "zh": "优柔寡断与不满", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "53c708b226392dac3b97d8c69697f92afa73c7edd3ddc16e1c61e966165b4167", "ja": "育と海美の誤解が解けた一方、千早との関係\nに悩む昴を、クラスメイトも心配していた。\n千早の事が気になって様子を見に来た昴は、\n環に千早への思いを問い質される。煮え切ら\nない返事の昴に、環は苛立ちをぶつける。", "zh": "育和海美之间的误会解开了，但同学们也很担心为与千早的关系而烦恼的昴。昴因为在意千早，前来看望她的情况，却被环追问对千早的心意。面对昴含糊不清的回答，环把自己的焦躁发泄了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "381cfccbecf74587b2f58d79ae25a6f01090d14e2ed62423f1e101e96aa8a4ae", "ja": "あの……今までのこと、ごめんなさいっ！\n上級生として、あるまじき態度だったわ……。", "zh": "那个……之前的事，对不起！\n我作为学姐，态度实在太不应该了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "38970819203c8ecdc1a5a4e2051904ecbc260b65fdbfc480082eb086ec758359", "ja": "い、いえ！　わたし、気にしてませんから。それに\nわたしも、高坂さんを驚かせたりしちゃったし……。", "zh": "没、没有啦！我不在意的。而且\n我也吓到高坂学姐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "b77ae82fce5555b6865ff52ffb8ed588c5f470e3537d2f19d1b865f47821280d", "ja": "その後、誤解の解けた育は、高坂さんや\nミス・ラベンダーと改めて仲良くなれたようだった……", "zh": "在那之后，解开了误会的育，似乎和高坂同学\n还有薰衣草小姐重新搞好了关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "194aba473857ea2fce9348d18c69057fba19f3d4cd6bfc2568dde791a5257479", "ja": "育ちゃん、海美さんと仲直りできたんですね。\n本当によかったです！", "zh": "小育，你和海美和好了啊。真的太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "67f87c6bd82b7324cd774a1f7c0a72988545350607b3b0a1b09f81c419787d32", "ja": "うん！　みんなには、心配かけちゃったから。\nちゃんと報告しなきゃって。", "zh": "嗯！因为让大家担心了。\n得好好跟大家说一声才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "ffe1a396a05b404360e070919d20c2b226fdb7f92607a4348eb6f7fcf6e35f35", "ja": "昴さん……？", "zh": "昴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "3b8b916c794c2c2959073f7f8e79c3c18777b00324f5b59146d890ef12308c9f", "ja": "もう……昴さんったら、バカね。\n遠慮しないで、私達に相談すればいいのに。", "zh": "真是的……昴也真是个笨蛋。\n明明不用客气，来找我们商量就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "0e919f4c38d51e59bf5a91b10645945e01a2bad4741de13a4527fc998221b4c0", "ja": "昨日、部長……琴葉さんの妹の静香さんが、\nフェンシング部に来てらしたの。", "zh": "昨天，部长……琴叶姐的妹妹静香，\n来了剑术部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "7e55ac2ff3d530e801c1e140bf53898a490acd539f65db364eb7edff14659f37", "ja": "千早さんとケンカをしてしまったって。", "zh": "听说她和千早小姐吵架了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "4e4d1303c0a880a7fcffb592a53d156a193b625438e7cf866f99ff1f465a6486", "ja": "千早さんて昴さんのお姉さまだよね？\nケンカって、どうして？", "zh": "千早姐姐是昴姐姐，对吧？\n为什么会吵架呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "a454ede4806daed8bd1b9ced5bfbb60798ad52106b435b6c8eafad35c615d258", "ja": "生徒会選挙のことが理由みたいだったわ。\n千早さんが美希さんの推薦人になったから……とか？", "zh": "听说好像是因为学生会选举的事。\n据说是因为千早小姐成了美希小姐的推荐人……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "f1b220dae3d81be5c2d3aae58a510a7adb645092d652f7105809f781f7f1be25", "ja": "……。\n本当に、それだけでしょうか……？", "zh": "……。\n真的只是因为那样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "f719d3ae8448308c2447ea79e7591d33b3f759b136fd81debd6a9105fed76403", "ja": "その後、恵美さんが副会長。\n高坂さんが生徒会長に立候補した。", "zh": "在那之后，惠美学姐参选副会长，\n高坂学姐参选了学生会长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "b968f48adb611481d75acbb9f0dba29a013c670b397c0d1f20db419ded627ec6", "ja": "数日後、全ての立候補者が公示され、\nいよいよミリオン女学園の生徒会選挙が始まった……", "zh": "几天后，所有的候选人都已公布，\n百万女学园的学生会选举终于拉开了帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "ad0ce67274110d5677803a3101d204d69660a17f83c03589b4c2e01459b0f2a3", "ja": "（気になって、様子を見に来てみたけど……\n千早さん、音楽室にはいないのかな）", "zh": "（我有点在意，所以过来看看，不过……千早姐不在音乐室吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "94087c5a67f6a877d614402191897dffe38ab70d6773d89b4767037b43c9d512", "ja": "何してるの、こんなところで。", "zh": "你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "be46fd76b8bf504fb42343ee70524d9076921edda1afaec4a209b18d8b3302c1", "ja": "大神さん……。", "zh": "大神同学……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "c86974c13205288a9a304493bab1b543d0633b9c8363bfe48407ccecaded0601", "ja": "キミを見てると、イライラする。妹なんてずるい。\n千早さんのこと好きなの、嫌いなの。どっち？", "zh": "看着你就让人来气。妹妹什么的，太狡猾了。\n你到底是喜欢千早，还是讨厌她？选一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "acc5d7c47e3aa5ac1dcc7377622ae18b37c54ed3e1055bffffaab9442a133f13", "ja": "す、好き……だと、思う。\nけど……。", "zh": "我、我觉得……是喜欢……吧。  \n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "b4d892f4967351233757ed34c84d2a316d30c6bf020b6744973fe8ae2c8fd89e", "ja": "だったら！\n……期待させないで。", "zh": "既然这样！\n……就别让我抱有期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "bce755e781e072de4f384d1e0bf4b7280664d2f1cff3af313be7497f0c076c3f", "ja": "……永吉さん？", "zh": "……永吉同学？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "911810927c67a0003d6381b77123628b7dab84289c1fc7ec308b64ea7582f0f0", "ja": "あっ……ち、千早さん……。", "zh": "啊……千、千早小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "3d59a33094f2aec1026b0676abbfcaf2890e9c37aa070bb796bbd4ea7145917c", "ja": "……？　大神さん、すこしいいかしら？\n永吉さんと、ふたりで話がしたいの。", "zh": "……？大神同学，能耽误你一点时间吗？\n我想和永吉同学单独谈谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "8397b7302e9fae6255394e04bdda866a64570153da90ac0fa6adb988ecf3c836", "ja": "っ……わかりました。\n失礼します……！", "zh": "……好的。\n失礼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1026_se", "source_sha256": "3acc3d8d20a36f0a3257a2150ed2ff29259cbfec1d7baf7c3ef5ae9411f0f515", "ja": "バタバタバタ……", "zh": "噔噔噔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "162acc2a41f2d03af324fdfcb92ffba771992e629aba1a8c4ce6402101f07d56", "ja": "あの……千早さん。\nわたしに話って……？", "zh": "那个……千早小姐。\n找我有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba2245e7c852b28a2d67861cc2bb13a719fa953e27b06ffb0618611ecfaa58c1", "ja": "あの。わたしと、姉妹になるっていう話……\nもう一度、考え直してほしいんです。", "zh": "那个。关于和我成为姐妹这件事……\n希望你能再重新考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_06_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "89ba037c411de34281621b5cac889591ad723b0895390625fd5b17084bb7ac12", "ja": "……わかったわ。", "zh": "……我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
